# Build fast, typed interfaces without giving up the web

Rocci connects the functional purity and compile-time guarantees of the Roc programming language with the universal reach of standard HTML, modern CSS, and lightweight desktop hosts.

---

## Why Rocci?

### 🛡️ Type-Safe Pure Functions
Every component is an ordinary, deterministic Roc function. Views are mathematical projections over state: no hidden lifecycle bugs, no unhandled edge cases, and zero runtime exceptions.

### 📄 Markdown-First Technical Documents
With Rocdown, write guides, articles, and API references in standard Markdown. Embed isolated Roc calculations, reactive snippets, and interactive components when needed without sacrificing static build performance.

### 🖥️ Native Desktop Shells
Package your interface as a lightweight, single-binary macOS or cross-platform application backed by Tao and Wry webviews. No heavyweight multi-hundred-megabyte runtimes.

### 🌐 Open Web Foundation
No proprietary UI abstractions or massive client bundles. Clean semantic HTML, standard CSS, and robust hypermedia updates powered by Datastar.

