## Quick Example

Here is how a counter component with scoped CSS looks in `.rocci`:

```roc
import Html

@component CounterCard = |{ count }| {
    <div class="counter-card">
        <h3>Counter: {Num.toStr(count)}</h3>
        <div class="actions">
            <button data-on-click="/increment">+1</button>
            <button data-on-click="/reset">Reset</button>
        </div>
    </div>
}

@css {
    .counter-card {
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--rd-color-border);
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
    }
}
```

